<LegalLayout
  title="Refund Policy — SyncLead"
  description="SyncLead's 14-day money-back guarantee, eligibility, cancellation terms, annual plan handling and how refunds are processed through Stripe."
  heading="Refund Policy"
  standfirst="Our commitment to your satisfaction with a 14-day money-back guarantee."
  lastUpdated="28 March 2026"
  lastUpdatedISO="2026-03-28"
  current="/refund"
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="guarantee">1. 14-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    SyncLead offers a 14-day money-back guarantee for all new subscriptions. If you are not satisfied with our B2B
    Sales Engagement Platform, you may request a full refund within 14 days of your initial purchase.
  </p>
  <p>To request a refund under this guarantee:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@synclead.io">contact@synclead.io</a> within 14 days of your initial
      subscription purchase.
    </li>
    <li>Include your account email address and reason for the refund request.</li>
    <li>We will process your refund within 5–10 business days to the original payment method.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="eligibility">2. Eligibility</h2>
  <p>The 14-day money-back guarantee applies to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>New subscriptions only:</strong> The guarantee applies to the first subscription purchase on your
      account.
    </li>
    <li><strong>All plans:</strong> Starter, Professional, and Scale plans are all eligible.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The guarantee does not apply to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Subscription renewals (second month and beyond).</li>
    <li>Plan upgrades or downgrades after the initial 14-day period.</li>
    <li>
      Accounts terminated for violation of our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> or
      <a href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="cancellations">3. Cancellations</h2>
  <p>
    You may cancel your SyncLead subscription at any time from your account settings or by contacting
    <a href="mailto:contact@synclead.io">contact@synclead.io</a>. Upon cancellation:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your access to paid features will continue until the end of your current billing cycle.</li>
    <li>No partial refunds are issued for unused time remaining in the current billing period.</li>
    <li>Cancellations are effective immediately — no further charges will be made after the current cycle ends.</li>
    <li>
      Your data will be retained for 30 days following the end of your subscription, after which it may be
      permanently deleted.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="annual-plans">4. Annual Subscriptions</h2>
  <p>For annual subscription plans:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The 14-day money-back guarantee still applies from the date of initial purchase.</li>
    <li>
      After the 14-day period, cancellations will take effect at the end of the annual billing cycle. No pro-rata
      refunds are issued for annual plans cancelled mid-term.
    </li>
    <li>
      If you wish to discuss special circumstances regarding an annual plan cancellation, please contact us at
      <a href="mailto:contact@synclead.io">contact@synclead.io</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="refund-processing">5. Refund Processing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>All refunds are processed through Stripe, our payment processor, to the original payment method.</li>
    <li>
      Refunds typically appear on your statement within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank or card issuer.
    </li>
    <li>Refunds are issued in the original currency of payment (USD).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="exceptions-disputes">6. Exceptions and Disputes</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe you are entitled to a refund that falls outside the standard 14-day window, please contact us at
    <a href="mailto:contact@synclead.io">contact@synclead.io</a> with a detailed explanation. We review all refund
    requests on a case-by-case basis and strive to reach a fair resolution.
  </p>
  <p>
    For billing disputes, please contact us first before initiating a chargeback with your bank. We are committed
    to resolving billing issues promptly and fairly.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact-us">7. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>For refund requests, billing questions, or cancellation assistance:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@synclead.io">contact@synclead.io</a></li>
    <li>Address: SYNCLEAD LTD, 20 Wenlock Road, London, England, N1 7GU</li>
    <li>Company Number: 15903993</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We aim to respond to all refund requests within 24 hours during business days.</p>
</LegalLayout>
